# NAS path for Forgejo's data (git repos, DB, LFS, attachments, custom
# config including app.ini). Own top-level shared folder, not under
# /path/to/docker — mirrors the paperless/mediarr pattern (backup-critical
# app data gets its own share, docker/ stays config-only). Must be a real
# DSM Shared Folder (Control Panel -> Shared Folder), not just a bare
# directory, so Hyper Backup can select it as a source.
FORGEJO_DATA_ROOT=/path/to/forgejo/data
